// 30MB per file. Script-writer endpoints accept up to 10 reference
// screenshots; phone screenshots from modern devices easily hit 8-15MB,
// and slide/article screenshots can push 20MB+. Keeping a per-file cap
// (rather than removing it) protects against runaway uploads.
